============================================
Non-blocking observations (informational)
============================================
O1. annotate_mesh_parameters / review_reconstruction keep `-> list` return
    annotations, but the launch/poll paths return str envelopes; annotation
    is now only accurate for the sync-success path. Cosmetic; FastMCP
    serializes a str return as text content regardless of the annotation.
O2. jobs.py catches Exception, not BaseException; a worker raising
    KeyboardInterrupt/SystemExit would vanish without a record (theoretical
    in a server process).
O3. get_job shallow copy aliases the stored mutable result (theoretical
    mutation vector; no current consumer mutates).
O4. No test asserts the 330s timeout propagation to _call for the str tools.
O5. Polling a completed image job re-serializes the full base64 payload on
    every poll until TTL; clients are expected to stop polling after
    completed. Minor.

